  "notes": "Flat-roofed 2-family corner 'kufsa' duplex: entire ground floor and the upper-floor corner/centre panels are clad in warm-grey concrete block courses (#c9bdb3, light joints), the rest of the upper floor is bright white stucco. Two big white balcony boxes cantilever over the entries - solid stucco parapets topped by curved GREEN wrought-iron rails (#587164); terraces entries use non-schema floor/at/w/depth fields (schema gap: terraces have no position/size control, and the curved bombe rail profile is not expressible). Both upper-floor window rows wear grey horizontal louvre shutters rather than clear glass (schema gap: no louvre/shutter style on openings - glass hex sampled from the louvres). Entry doors are dark steel with a decorative laser-cut leaf pattern (schema gap), set in deep recessed porches through the block skin; round white globe sconces sit on each balcony box face. Frontage: same concrete-block compound walls at varying heights forming an L-shaped front yard, grey vertical-bar pedestrian gate, full terracotta herringbone brick paving from the porches across the sidewalk (#ce9c7a), asphalt road at left with a light concrete kerb strip (#c6b7aa), and to the right a grass verge with round dark-green hedge blobs (#344b36/#93b58c highlights) - hedges pending prop factory. The AniRacers track with colour blocks is visible far right in the ref background (ignore for the building program). Sampled colours from 12x9 + 24x18 grids 2026-07-03."
